[b]0.2.10[/b]
[list]
[*]Fixed a case where card highlights or tooltips could linger after an action on some systems.
[*]Controller input no longer interrupts a card drag or another touch gesture while your finger is still down. You can switch back to the controller after the action finishes.
[*]Added simulated input tests on Windows and Linux. There has been no Steam Deck hardware testing because I don't have a device; feedback from Deck players is welcome.
[/list]

[list]
[*]修复部分系统上操作结束后，卡牌高亮或提示可能残留的问题。
[*]手指还未松开时，手柄输入不会再打断拖牌等触屏操作。操作完成后，仍可切回手柄。
[*]新增 Windows 和 Linux 模拟输入测试。由于没有 Steam Deck 实机，目前尚未进行实机测试，欢迎 Deck 玩家反馈体验和问题。
[/list]
